  fhir:ConceptMap.purpose [ fhir:value "Guide implementers in understanding how the coarse-grained priority categories defined in the EHDS regulation relate to specific document categories identified by LOINC codes, and it may evolve over time as clinical practice changes and new document categories become relevant for cross-border exchange."] ;
